<!--
    An adaptive icon's FOREGROUND layer: 108dp of which only the inner 72
    survives the launcher's mask, and less again once it shrinks the layer to
    make room for its own shape. The 24dp Material glyph is therefore scaled
    to 50dp and centred by hand rather than drawn edge to edge — a group
    transform, since a vector has no gravity.

    Tinted @color/ic_launcher_ink, which is black under values/colors.xml and
    white under values-night: the launcher draws this in its own process and
    its own configuration, so it follows the SYSTEM light/dark setting and
    cannot be asked what the browser's own ThemeMode is.
-->
